I finally ascended! Yeah.  Some noteworthy items I think worth mentioning 
if you are trying to complete your first ascension.


1) Get a ring of conflict.  I didn't have one until I entered the Wiz's
castle.  It makes a big big difference on later levels.
2) You got to have some sort of weapon which kills any monster in one turn 
whether it is Finger of Death, vorpal blade, ToM etc.  (makes killing the 
wiz easier especially when he pops in and out all the time.  I ended upu
killing him 30 times before I made it to the Astral plane)  My +8 silver
saber was peanuts against a vorpal blade.
3) Get a cloak of protection.  While the short time I was without one, I 
got three levels drained in one encounter with a vamp.  Never got another 
drained with a cloak.

Questions for the experienced players:
1) I ended up killing Jublilex twice  but I thought you could only
 kill demons once and then they're gone.
2) On the astral plane, my God's servants were attacking me. Why?
  When I attacked the High Priestess, my God got angry and tried to 
  blow me up.
3)  Why is it that the monsters attack 3 to 4 times for every 1
time you attack.  That doesn't seem very fair.  (I had very fast attribute)


In the end, I was level 26 Valk, -36AC  (-10 more than when I started on the Astral plane, good magic items on this plane), memorized 24 spells (is that all 
of them?),  I died 3 times (3 AoLS), 23 dexterity, didn't use a wish until the
WoZendor kept popping back and killing me (I wanted to make it through the 
whole game without using them, but alas I would have never of made it withou
wishing for a vorpal blade), and this version 3.1.3 was MUCH MUCH easier than
3.0 that I played a few months ago.


Note to the designers:  Make artifact weapons more available in the game so
you can eliminate WoW ( it makes me feel like I'm cheating), and take out
the magic markers (they're almost as bad as WoWs).

